### Out-of-scope (per-diem) — compile
### YAS doesn't carry per-diem; defers to NHS T&Cs. Should refuse cleanly.
POST http://localhost:3000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's the per-diem for Band 8a in London?"
}

